[{"id":4296466607,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABABbgrw","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"d6f33b72ea5553535a6499105c61c002b8a441f4","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","login":"HolonProduction","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"I think this is a good idea. The approach of starting with a warning and then removing it if there is no sufficient pushback seems like a good midground between compat, and something that's just a loaded footgun for users.\n\nMaybe relevant context: Prior to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116369 builtin singletons were limited to directly inheriting `Object` through a test case. This might have been originally meant to prevent ref counted singletons. The fact that it did not cover user registered singletons might have been a mistake. (Just my interpretation in trying to frame this as a bug though 😅)","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119429#pullrequestreview-4296466607","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119429","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-15T08:11:20Z"},{"id":4297047625,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAB--SQ","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"dd29447f44e0e59a88cc1ff08ab30563a6233326","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/708488?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Bromeon","id":708488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","login":"Bromeon","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon"},"body":"Thanks for the review!\n\nI reduced to a single warning in `Engine::add_singleton`, which is used by all code paths. Also removed suggestion of \"Node\" in warning message, focusing on \"Object\" alone.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119429#pullrequestreview-4297047625","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119429","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-05-15T09:35:34Z"},{"id":4297448585,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABACXciQ","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"dd29447f44e0e59a88cc1ff08ab30563a6233326","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"Agreed, and I'd slate this for a 4.7 merge so it's outphased soon. There's no need for `RefCounted` singleton support. It's strictly worse than the `Object` variant.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119429#pullrequestreview-4297448585","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119429","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-15T10:43:52Z"},{"id":4297451590,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABACXoRg","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"dd29447f44e0e59a88cc1ff08ab30563a6233326","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following"